NAME Hopper feed
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Sand drops from its feeder into a hopper; a\nblower carries what the hopper lets out across\nto a bucket.\nThe second hopper only catches water and lets\nit drain straight down by gravity.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Turn the blower off: the hopper fills up and\nspills over its rim.\nChange the hopper gate in Properties.

